{#- ⚠️ **S147, J-7 — `glyph` is a VALUE, not markup, and that is why the emoji
    survive here.** Four callers pass `material.icon ?: '📦'` as a Twig string, so
    an `{% include %}` cannot go in its place: it would be a literal include tag
    inside a quoted argument, which is a syntax error (paid for once, in this
    session). Teaching this partial to take an icon NAME — `glyph_icon: 'box'` —
    and render `_icon.html.twig` itself is the real fix, and it is a change to
    this component plus its four callers, not a search-and-replace. -#}
{#
   THE MEDIA CELL — a thumbnail or an avatar, at one size (S134i).

   Parameters:

     src       a ready URL, or null/'' for no image
     alt       the alternative text. ⚠️ Required when `src` is set; a thumbnail
               whose alt is the row's name is the only thing that makes the row
               findable without sight.
     initials  the fallback when there is no image but there IS an identity —
               a person, a venue. Rendered as the initials disc.
     glyph     the fallback when the row has a chosen symbol rather than a name
               to abbreviate: the emoji a material or a loanable item carries.
               Preferred over `initials` when both are given.
     shape     square (default) | circle
     reason    passed to `_cell_empty` when there is neither

   ⚠️ **No `onerror` fallback here, deliberately.** `_user_avatar` has one
   because it points at an upload path that may have been pruned; this cell is
   handed a URL the caller already resolved. Silently swapping a broken image
   for a placeholder is how a missing-file bug lives for a year.

   ⚠️ EXIF orientation is the uploader's job, not this file's — a portrait photo
   stored with an orientation tag renders sideways in a 40 px box exactly as it
   does at full size. See the S80 upload path.
#}
{% if src|default('') %}
    <img class="cell-media{{ shape|default('square') == 'circle' ? ' is-circle' : '' }}"
         src="{{ src }}" alt="{{ alt|default('') }}" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy">
{% elseif glyph|default('') %}
    <span class="cell-media is-glyph{{ shape|default('square') == 'circle' ? ' is-circle' : '' }}" aria-hidden="true">{{ glyph }}</span>
{% elseif initials|default('') %}
    <span class="cell-media is-initials{{ shape|default('circle') == 'square' ? '' : ' is-circle' }}" aria-hidden="true">{{ initials|slice(0, 2)|upper }}</span>
{% else %}
    {% include 'site/_cell_empty.html.twig' with {reason: reason|default('cell.no_image')} only %}
{% endif %}
